type: software
title: "Markdown Desk"
abstract: "Self-contained, single-file HTML tool for reading, writing, and annotating local Markdown files: project workspace, highlights, notes, bookmarks, stylus ink and text labels, PDF/PNG/ZIP export, and PWA installability. Runs entirely in the browser with no server or telemetry."
